&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Designing, developing and implementing efficient code for various components of the team&#39;s low latency, high throughput production trading and research systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Developing systems that provide easy, highly efficient access to historical market data and trading simulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
