&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and improve&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI-driven quantitative investment strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in financial markets within the dedicated China research team. Support all strategies from alpha generation through to trade execution and implementation, working closely with other team members to design, build, and enhance strategies using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;cutting-edge machine learning and AI techniques&lt;/strong&gt;. Core responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
