&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Position Overview:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Squarepoint is looking for recent graduates who are hoping to kickstart their financial technology careers in a global team of exceptional Application support specialists.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will leverage your technical expertise, analytical mindset, and curiosity about financial markets to help ensure the stability, performance, and resilience of critical trading applications. Working at the heart of the production environment, you will monitor and support services within the full trade lifecycle across a sophisticated global trading platform, partnering closely with traders, quants, developers, and infrastructure teams to resolve issues and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to define and enhance operational processes, lead the onboarding of new trading services, and take ownership of production support for business-critical systems. You will be empowered to identify opportunities for automation, improve system reliability, and contribute directly to the efficiency and scalability of our trading operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your skills in a highly collaborative and fast-paced environment where your contributions have immediate impact. Gain firsthand exposure to how a leading global investment firm operates at scale, and play a key role in maintaining the operational excellence that underpins our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Mathematics, Mechanical Engineering or a similar discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of at least one of: Python, Bash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General knowledge of database technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, attention to detail and ability to work within a global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to continuously learn new technologies and develop with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and driven by the challenge of solving new problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience working in a similar environment, demonstrated through work experience or personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
