db2aa3192a7ffc9c76b9869408f01d5cdca19492:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk Technology is a global team that designs, builds and maintains Squarepoint’s trading risk platform, which is responsible for trade capture, position management, profit/loss computation, inventory/locate management and internal order routing. These critical systems need to be performant, resilient, and capable of timely processing of high volumes of trading data in both live and historical scenarios, requiring solutions to process, propagate and store rapidly changing datasets efficiently. The Risk platform is undergoing significant investment to build a new service orientated architecture. We’re looking for talented engineers with a passion for software development who enjoy working in a dynamic, global and collaborative environment, with a strong focus on engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering, Computer Science or related subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years’ C++ Linux based development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data structures and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Team player with excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scalable large-scale / distributed systems / service-oriented architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing code for high performance applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with messaging systems (e.g., Kafka, AMPS, QPID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, bash and/or Q/KDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

2a674b1e64cf11ddd92da8eab437ef5e78292e88:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarepoint is looking for a Desktop Support Analyst to support a global community of approximately 500 + users in a Windows environment. Candidate will interact onsite and remotely with users to provide support with workstation applications such as Microsoft Exchange/Outlook, Microsoft Office in an on premise or cloud-based solution; access control policies via Windows Active Directory; remote access assistance and hardware issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide 24x5 support on-site and to a global community of approximately 500 + users as per business requirement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call weekend support on a rotational basis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage raised requests and incidents in a timely manner following well-rehearsed internal request runbooks/knowledge based and incident management and request fulfillment processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Level 2 &amp;amp; 3 internal and external teams/vendors as appropriate to help troubleshoot more complex incidents;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide alert management to pro-active resolve failure alerts, degraded services and unavailable services through internal monitoring tools;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively automate common tasks to improve efficiency and increase productivity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal and external teams to develop strategic solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform related duties &amp;amp; responsibilities as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience in a Microsoft environment supporting Windows 10, Windows Server 2012+, Office Suite including Outlook, Office 365 and Azure, including OneDrive, DLP and SharePoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience with Active Directory, Group Policy, remote access solutions and software deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge and experience installing, troubleshooting and managing desktop hardware;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless dedication to customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with minimum supervision, proactively follows up on outstanding issues/tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple tasks with changing priorities and capable to handle frequent interruptions positively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, prioritizing, interpersonal, problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated collaborative skills and ability to work well within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced and deadline-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with critical attention to detail, deadlines and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in learning about new and emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed learner and ability to find solutions to problems they have not encountered before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Engineering or related field or experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal !msorm;&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Powershell and Python;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

fce8890be243a8754e3bb7394b573ea66761b46a:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Support Analyst - Trade Flow Pilot:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate on-boarding and migration of trading flows with technology and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipe cleaning of new asset classes to be traded in the firm using internal applications and broker/exchanges before the full-scale trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gatekeep the production environment by reviewing the changes in technology space; Create and maintain internal tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Day of Support Analyst:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct scheduled pipe cleaning activities with regional trading desks and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out analysis, planning &amp;amp; execution for any ongoing on boarding, migration projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and provide feedback on changes going into production wherever gaps are identified, CAB approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide assistance to trade floor support, operations and trading desks on any queries raised related to the trading flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skill Set Required for Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the financial domain and different types of asset classes (at least listed ones - Equities &amp;amp; Derivatives)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with colleagues across multiple regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Linux based environments and proficiency in at least one scripting language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of trading fundamentals, including market types and asset classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, kdb+/q experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

c7cf7b9a54f03c5f809080133f9da7f58259da5f:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;As a Technical Business Analyst , you will be the key driver of the entire project lifecycle; starting from using requirements elicitation techniques to gather business requirements, identify problems or discover gaps, evaluate project objectives and track progress, to ultimately ensure successful delivery of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;This presents the opportunity to take ownership of the business objectives and the development of technology solutions to facilitate the growth of the business. You will act as the primary interface between senior stakeholders, Business Product Management Team, Quantitative Research, Trading, Development, Quality Assurance, Production Support and Infrastructure Teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main responsibilities for&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Technical Business Analysts&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current business processes and establish the full picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical needs and problems to solve based on thorough analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and scope requirements into technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solutions, propose implementation options, provide evaluations and recommendations to make optimal decisions for the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the product design that aligns with firm-wide goals by collaborating with business and technology stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain product and project specifications with exceptionally high level of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage functional/technical knowledge and content and drive outstanding questions towards closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish project implementation plan and proactively&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;bb771112-4332-4df9-ae92-ff32af981d89&quot;&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;project progress while managing multiple priorities and communicating the priorities effectively to the project stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate for this role should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong requirement elicitation skills: ability to capture, conceptualize and structure requirements to simple, concise and comprehensive requirement specifications to minimize requirement gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation skills: ability to create and maintain highly accurate requirement specifications, project and product documents according to Squarepoint documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to abstract concepts, identify gaps and subtle differences, connect dots, internalize information, relate information to implications and question effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and maintain strategic partnerships with senior management, project stakeholders and end users globally, as well as communicate effectively across business and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding on software/hardware concepts, software architecture design and software development lifecycle (Waterfall or Agile).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of various asset classes in either listed or OTC financial instruments such as Equities, Futures, Options or Fixed Income instruments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, independent, reliable, collaborative and strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-organized, exceptionally high level of accuracy in both written and verbal communication and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on multiple projects simultaneously across different&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;3a4e17ad-2179-4cab-93d1-3fdf974818b4&quot;&gt;domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years of total industry experience within finance with at least 2 years in a Technical Business Analyst position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on programming experience is required, preferably in Python or KDB+/q.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlassian Confluence and JIRA expertise is required, including corresponding macros/plug-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in initiating, defining, driving&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;096bfc8b-84c8-431f-99f0-9604e2647703&quot;&gt;and implementing&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;projects with explicitly scoped project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a Computer Science, Engineering field or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Microservice, Domain-Driven Design, API Design, cloud-native applications, distributed systems and DevOps is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

b9cc73afca12b347a81d6c99e0f1769955241f7d:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integration projects team plays a crucial role in the analysis, planning, and coordination of upgrades, rollouts, and decommission across firm’s trading, research, and UX’s front-to-back workflows. As an integral member of team, you will collaborate closely with a wide range of technology teams and quantitative researchers, offering you the opportunity to gain a deep understanding of technology architecture, business operations, and to develop your project management and organizational skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Project manage large scale firm wide roll outs of applications and infrastructure, user migrations from legacy to newer systems, high impact changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Project manage business/external driven requirements requiring cross team coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as liaison between technology teams, business users and external parties during various stages of application and infrastructure delivery for in-scope projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Increase transparency for stakeholders by maintaining quality project tracking documentation and regular communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Use of scripting/automations for project impact assessment and data collection for migration tracking dashboards.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of software/hardware/network concepts, software development life cycle and processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Bash and any scripting language such as Python or Perl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Atlassian stack (JIRA, Service Desk, Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to reporting tools like Tableau Dashboard, Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

d825eaee7355236b4ee468718cc9e25718605d88:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global trading platform readiness: pre-trading &amp;amp; post-trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide monitoring and support for end to end transaction flow across the trading platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly identify, analyze and correct alerts &amp;amp; issues and/or escalate to minimize trade flow impact and preempt outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident management: create and send reports following established process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intensive interaction with trading community, back office operations, brokers, exchanges, development and infrastructure teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scheduled changes: application deployments, network implementations and server maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee automated processes, scheduled jobs and regular reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage users’ requests: track requests, review approvals, updates, resolution, closure, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies such as repetitive activities, manual processes and suboptimum tools/workflows to drive continuous improvements via automation, collaboration with internal and external teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on trade flow support experience a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Bash and a scripting language such as Python or Perl required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed practical knowledge of FIX. Ideally, familiarity with native exchange protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kdb+ is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge with TCP/IP, multicast, tcpdump, clocking (PTP, NTP) – a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, Engineering or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detailed, control oriented, enjoys solving problems and brings in a &quot;take charge&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal/written communication skills required to support daily interaction with brokers, exchanges, and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated individual that takes initiatives and has an ownership &amp;amp; accountability mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must show the ability to make quick decisions and establish priorities in a multi-tasking &amp;amp; fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Atlassian stack (JIRA, Service Desk, Confluence, Bitbucket, Bamboo), Elastic Stack and Nagios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ITIL is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

e9c5f87909c121156357cdd0ff9ecf1c4dcbeeef:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Trading Infrastructure Support Engineer will be part of a highly talented team of support engineers responsible for ensuring high availability of&amp;nbsp;Squarepoint’s&amp;nbsp;mission&amp;nbsp;critical services such Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS), Build &amp;amp; Deploy, Research&amp;nbsp;and Trading. The candidate will be responsible for providing L1/L2 support across all services globally distributed across APAC, EMEA&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;AMER&amp;nbsp;regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide monitoring and&amp;nbsp;L1/L2&amp;nbsp;support across all&amp;nbsp;services and quickly react to any outages to maintain a highly available environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly identify, analyze and correct alerts &amp;amp; issues and/or escalate to minimize trade flow impact and preempt outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intensive interaction with trading community,&amp;nbsp;external vendors,&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and infrastructure&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee automated processes, scheduled jobs and regular reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp;users’ requests:&amp;nbsp;track requests,&amp;nbsp;review&amp;nbsp;approvals,&amp;nbsp;updates,&amp;nbsp;resolution, closure, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies such as repetitive activities, manual processes and suboptimum tools/workflows to drive continuous improvements via automation, collaboration with internal and external teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of support experience a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Linux/Unix&amp;nbsp;administration (RHEL/CentOS/OEL preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Python,&amp;nbsp;Bash&amp;nbsp;scripting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working&amp;nbsp;knowledge of storage and different storage protocols (nfs &amp;nbsp;gpfs a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure automation (Chef, Puppet or Ansible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or like messaging buses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CICD tooling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Monitoring infrastructure (ELK and Prometheus preferred)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database administration experience (MySql&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;PosgreSql&amp;nbsp;preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in container software administration (Docker,&amp;nbsp;Podman,&amp;nbsp;Kubernetes, GKE&amp;nbsp;or Helm preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge with TCP/IP, multicast,&amp;nbsp;tcpdump, clocking (PTP, NTP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate network equipment command line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree&amp;nbsp;in Computer Science, Engineering or related subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized,&amp;nbsp;detailed, control oriented,&amp;nbsp;enjoys solving problems and&amp;nbsp;brings in&amp;nbsp;a &quot;take charge&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal/written communication skills required to support daily interaction with internal teams,&amp;nbsp;external vendors and service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated individual that takes initiatives and has an ownership &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;accountability mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must show the ability to make quick decisions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;establish priorities in a multi-tasking &amp;amp; fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;ITIL is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

7abfe45d39e5e210e884dcf346319c12ea8f756e:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Squarepoint is seeking a hands-on Trading Infrastructure Support (TIS) Tech Lead to manage a global TIS team. The candidate will lead a team of support specialist, ensuring high availability of Squarepoint’s mission-critical infrastructure, systems, and platform application services across APAC, EMEA, and AMER regions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Manage a 24x5 global support schedule and weekend on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define policies, processes, roadmaps, and best practices to meet SLAs and scale with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with service teams to build automation, self-service tools, and runbooks. Ensure the team is trained, skilled, and empowered to remove blockers and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and eliminate inefficiencies across workflows and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and coordinate technical efforts across the global support team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with troubleshooting and&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;major outage recovery efforts to minimize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Main Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a 24x5 global support schedule and weekend on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define policies, processes, roadmaps, and best practices to meet SLAs and scale with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with service teams to build automation, self-service tools, and runbooks. Ensure the team is trained, skilled, and empowered to remove blockers and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and eliminate inefficiencies across workflows and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and coordinate technical efforts across the global support team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with troubleshooting and&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;major outage recovery efforts to minimize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in Linux/Unix administration (RHEL/CentOS/OEL preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of CI/CD practices, including observability, orchestration, containerization, automated testing, deployment pipelines, and configuration management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;leading a technology team, ideally in infrastructure support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal, written, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service orientation and strategic mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, prioritization, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of storage protocols (NFS, GPFS a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure automation tools (Chef, Puppet, Ansible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of networking fundamentals (TCP/IP, multicast, tcpdump, PTP, NTP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL knowledge is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

72d3d7ec7f240f209f5737520fc09e8fdf1a1b12:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please only apply to the one job you feel best fits your skillset and experience. If our team feels you are better suited for another role, we will reach out about the alternate opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Trading Applications Specialist at Squarepoint, you will work in a global team of exceptional technologists with the primary focus of ensuring reliability and stability of our trading services. You will develop a deep understanding of financial markets, combining this knowledge with strong technical skills to support systematic trading applications and other critical software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will step into a high responsibility role, taking ownership of incident management and root cause elimination through process improvements. Trading Applications Specialists drive continuous innovation via automation and optimisation of our daily workflows. In this role you will learn how we manage application outages and minimise their negative impact on our large-scale global trading operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out ready for business checks ahead of the &#39;start-of-day&#39; to ensure a smooth market open, resolving any failures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor trading applications and execution strategies, utilising our proprietary observability frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out post trade checks and resolve reporting issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your critical thinking skills and manage outages that impact the trading environment, reducing production downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on a wide range of projects, including: onboarding of new applications, services and products into the production environment or developing tools and scripts to automate operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Mechanical Engineering, Mathematics or a similar discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 4 years experience in a similar environment, buy or sell side&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux, Python, Bash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of at least one of the following asset classes: equities, fixed income, derivatives, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, attention to detail and ability to work within a global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to continuously learn new technologies and develop with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and driven by the challenge of solving new problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with either of: kdb+/q, MSSQL, PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with the FIX protocol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of TCP/IP concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

e9f0b6c8853b920d77211dcf3a6310589cb554bb:
&lt;p&gt;Trading Infrastructure Specialists play an important role maintaining &lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;3ffbf428-4e3c-43f1-a952-9dc6ff807ec5&quot;&gt;mission critical trading software and systems&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the Squarepoint technology stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will be joining our Trading Infrastructure Support Team on an 18-month rotation programme. During this time, you will be exposed to a wide array of technologies across our Infrastructure estate and be supported by&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;4a2f17d6-1445-47e0-a076-79e229a55702&quot;&gt;established members of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the end of the rotation, you will have the tools and knowledge to move into one of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;0718d906-2b83-4f0e-8293-a895d734c2d7&quot;&gt;DevOps/Systems&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;teams,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;46207b07-1ed2-406a-8e1d-e3bb63039e04&quot;&gt;or you can opt to stay within Trading Infrastructure Support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things you will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be enrolled in a structured training programme with a dedicated mentor who will support you throughout your journey here at Squarepoint. Within the first few months you will learn about the tech stacks for our infrastructure teams and gain exposure to our application stack for trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside our support team to learn how we address user issues, understand our handling standards, and gain the ability to triage and prioritise problems as they come up. You will have the opportunity to work with technologies such as Linux, Kubernetes, high-performance computing (HPC), distributed storage, load balancing, and more. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Towards the end of the programme there will be 1-week rotations within our DevOps and Systems teams so that you can gain hands-on experience within those areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once initial training is complete, a normal day in this role could involve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;bded1765-39fe-4249-a7c3-63e9f36712b0&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting and automation across a wide array of core systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;54d17a6b-3982-40b7-83c3-5339b81e5643&quot;&gt;Engaging with service owners&amp;nbsp;on day-to-day operational issues,&amp;nbsp;triage, manage and&amp;nbsp;resolving incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c78eb32e-86bc-43ae-b3ba-e39dbfa86207&quot;&gt;Supporting observability, workload schedulers, databases, and Linux systems depending on team needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1655f8d4-5064-4eb3-883c-202cc806b4ac&quot;&gt;Contributing to automation tasks using Python, Bash, or Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;92fd872a-de7e-4362-8f48-38c9e35abbdb&quot;&gt;Maintain monitoring, alerting, and logging pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d0c36c0e-4e15-476e-addc-50e3b8b95782&quot;&gt;Document issues, update runbooks, to aid your colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d6ca1c60-447f-4270-a3a7-9b4da8b5eefe&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in engineering, Computer Science, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;338d83bd-7e40-4f08-80e1-1a8f610f0ecc&quot;&gt;Basic Linux knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;473a38b6-5596-4681-bce0-4eb3dfec8389&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;21b6ba36-1d90-476e-afe8-aa44f39448e4&quot;&gt;Understanding of fundamentals of hardware infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ed5ca71e-8864-4262-b978-810767578e2f&quot;&gt;The ability to remain calm under pressure, assess competing priorities and remain well-organised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;cc9fe988-a733-4810-875d-91182c71dc23&quot;&gt;Scientific curiousity and desire to learn and continuously improve system performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;00d1e264-2670-4859-95ed-c886d4c0b164&quot;&gt;Good communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;74045501-62d9-473c-b532-2e9da82160f5&quot;&gt;Exposure to one or more of containers, Kubernetes, VMs, Distributed Storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;10493b37-510a-4913-8ef1-e118b91d48ee&quot;&gt;Understanding of modern telemetry tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;f4785e2d-7643-40aa-ada5-9b1811716530&quot;&gt;Interest in HPC, Schedulers, or CI/CD systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

f4c21d1c510d24afbc9d460c160265823581dd0c:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is a global proprietary trading firm that leverages state-of-the-art technology and research to identify and execute profitable trading strategies across multiple asset classes around the world. Our offices in Chicago, New York, and London are all composed of naturally-curious individuals who thrive in a team environment and constantly strive for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is a quantitative proprietary trading firm that is currently recruiting a Fundamental Research Analyst to support our International Trading desk between 5:00 pm CT - 4:00 am CT in our Chicago Headquarters. As a Fundamental Research Analyst, you will be responsible for conducting research and monitoring news around the globe with the goal of discovering new investment opportunities. You’ll work closely with the desk leads to produce reports that will have an impact on our trading strategies.&amp;nbsp; Staying current and sharing information with our traders will make you a valuable member of our team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; News junkies are encouraged to apply and help our firm make real-time trading decisions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and analyze news/events/information that will have an impact on our trading group(s) and report pertinent information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support traders by being the sole point of contact for conducting research and following all global macro events that could impact the price of certain securities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and work directly with small trading groups on analyzing data for patterns as well as&amp;nbsp;developing new ideas/tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+&amp;nbsp; years of relevant work experience in a Research Analyst Role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable passion for the financial markets as well as for problem solving and pattern recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, both written and verbal, with the ability to handle multiple tasks in a time-sensitive, fast-paced, collaborative, and collegial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong quantitative, analytical and research-oriented skill set.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Bloomberg and/or Reuters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming skills in Python will get you bonus points!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully paid Medical, Dental, Vision, Disability, and Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully stocked kitchen; free breakfast and lunch every day on-site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Vacation, Sick, and Parental leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter and Flexible Spending Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$150,000 - $200,000 - Salaries are based on numerous factors such as skills, experience, and education. Our compensation package also includes a discretionary bonus and a comprehensive benefits program for full-time employees. For more information, reach out to your recruiter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Old Mission is not accepting unsolicited resumes from any staffing/search firms. All resumes submitted by staffing/search firms to any employee at Old Mission via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid signed search agreement will be deemed the sole property of Old Mission, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Old Mission.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

c4baa56812de59b96cdf5a943d80ddae073026ea:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Old Mission is a global proprietary trading firm that leverages state-of-the-art technology and research to identify and execute profitable trading strategies across multiple asset classes around the world. Our offices in Chicago, New York, and London are all composed of naturally-curious individuals who thrive in a team environment and constantly strive for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role in every sense. The Tax Manager works alongside the Tax Director, not behind them. Both positions are expected to work together: preparing workpapers, reviewing returns, conducting primary research, owning compliance deadlines, and building the analysis that informs the firm’s tax positions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;U.S. International Tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Prepare and own U.S. international tax compliance workpapers and supporting schedules across the firm&#39;s controlled foreign corporations and partnerships, including GILTI/NCTI, FDII/FDDEI, BEAT, Subpart F, foreign tax credits and FTC limitation analysis, and foreign withholding and treaty positions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain and update CFC and partnership analyses including tested income, tested loss, net&amp;nbsp;deemed&amp;nbsp;tangible income return calculations, and high-tax exclusion&amp;nbsp;evaluations;&amp;nbsp;coordinate with external advisors on FTC planning and transfer pricing strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor the impact of OBBBA, evolving IRS guidance, and OECD Pillar Two developments on the firm&#39;s international tax positions and assess implications for compliance and planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support transfer pricing documentation and intercompany agreements for cross-border transactions between U.S. and foreign entities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Federal, State &amp;amp; Local Tax Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prepare tax return information packages and detailed workpapers for external tax consulting firms; independently review all externally prepared federal and state returns prior to submission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support preparation and review of indirect tax filings including VAT, Use Tax, and GST across applicable domestic and international&amp;nbsp;jurisdictions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own withholding and information reporting obligations for Forms 1099, 1042-S, and 8804 for the firm and its related entities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;the firm’s tax compliance calendar; proactively&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;all upcoming deadlines and coordinate&amp;nbsp;timely&amp;nbsp;completion with internal teams and outside advisors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Research, Planning &amp;amp; Authority Response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Conduct primary research on federal,&amp;nbsp;state&amp;nbsp;and local, and international tax issues; prepare well-reasoned technical memos for Tax Director review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prepare substantive responses to information document requests (IDRs) from the IRS, state, and city taxing authorities;&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;organized examination support files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Monitor and assess legislative and regulatory developments including IRS guidance, Treasury regulations, and OECD Pillar Two updates; brief the Tax Director on implications for the firm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Provide tax analysis in support of proposed transactions, new entity structures, and strategic initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Process, Data &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;and implement process improvements to tax workflows; evaluate new tools and procedures for more&amp;nbsp;accurate, efficient compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Leverage Excel (Power Query, XLOOKUP, PivotTables, array formulas) and AI research tools to streamline workpaper preparation, data manipulation, and reconciliation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Document and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;policies, procedures, and internal controls for the Tax function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally with&amp;nbsp;Accounting, Legal, and Operations on tax matters, regulatory reporting, and ad hoc special projects as directed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Required&amp;nbsp;Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;6–8+&amp;nbsp;years of tax experience; public accounting background at the Manager or experienced Senior level strongly preferred (Big 4, national firm, or strong regional with FS practice)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Genuine hands-on technical depth in U.S.&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;international tax,&amp;nbsp;direct experience preparing and reviewing GILTI/NCTI, Subpart F, and foreign tax credit workpapers; conceptual familiarity alone will not meet the bar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience preparing and independently reviewing federal and&amp;nbsp;state&amp;nbsp;tax returns and workpapers, preferably in a&amp;nbsp;financial services, partnership, or trading firm context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of indirect tax,&amp;nbsp;VAT, Use Tax, or GST in a compliance setting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CPA licensed or within one exam section of completion (active license strongly preferred)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Advanced Excel&amp;nbsp;proficiency,&amp;nbsp;XLOOKUP, PivotTables, Power Query, SUMIF/SUMIFS; comfort manipulating large financial datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and organizational discipline; able to manage multiple high-stakes deadlines without dropping the ball&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Impeccable ethics, integrity, and proven ability to handle confidential and market-sensitive information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prior experience in a financial services tax environment,&amp;nbsp;proprietary trading firm, hedge fund, or investment partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Transfer pricing experience, including intercompany agreements and benchmarking documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Exposure to Pillar Two / OECD Global Minimum Tax framework and its interaction with U.S. GILTI rules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with SALT filings and withholding requirements for investment partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Familiarity with ASC 740 income tax accounting and quarterly tax provision work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with tax research databases,&amp;nbsp;Thomson Reuters Checkpoint, Bloomberg Tax, or CCH&amp;nbsp;AnswerConnect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of AI tools applied to tax research, drafting, and workflow automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;BS/BA in Accounting or Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
