&lt;li&gt;Past industry experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Teaching Assistant and/or participation in relevant Olympiads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with machine learning, data analysis, market research and data modeling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anticipated New York and Chicago weekly base salary range $3,500-5,700.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Housing accommodation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exciting networking and social events (e.g. Broadway shows, escape rooms, cooking classes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn from senior management across the firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentors from your alma mater and other top institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;

3bf0220baf8542c049b00c05f56b368134e96e5f:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a junior DM corporate credit analyst who will be supervised by a senior analyst in charge of covering a given set of sectors/regions on both bonds and loans instruments across the full risk spectrum, and contributing to a collection of fundamental credit strategies across our hedge fund and CLO vehicles. The role of the junior analyst will be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the senior analyst by collecting information, attending investor presentations, running credit analysis and documenting credit memos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the senior analyst monitoring thoroughly and actively the fundamentals and market dynamics of all issuers in coverage on both bonds and loans instruments (notably across earnings or any events)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the buildout of the new Squarepoint CLO platform along with our CLO management PMs and DCM heads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our fundamental business for the hedge fund centered around primary, short duration and alpha capture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degrees from top universities in Finance/Accounting/Economics/Mathematics/Statistics or related subjects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in researching, analyzing and modelling data – ideally through prior internship experience or in a related position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 - 4 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a bank desk analyst from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High Yield/loans/distressed desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Origination desk focusing on leveraged finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investment banking/M&amp;amp;A division covering any sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or in a buy-side firms:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long only credit asset managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLO shops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credit specialists HFs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-strategy HFs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big 4 auditing firms:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting/advisory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deals/transaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit teams covering any sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding skill in Python and ease with Excel is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing skills and ability to quickly synthesize thoughts and organize information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to tackle any project or task that is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to work well with colleagues across multiple teams and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to work under pressure and deliver under tight timelines &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $150,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

7526e08b9e5ba1dd0575d50912736d80ab5cb9fa:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to gain challenging and interesting experience in Man’s Enterprise Engineering Support team that covers Man’s business systems and infrastructure including both in house developed and third party systems which includes a wide range of asset classes traded; working closely with Business users across Front, Middle &amp;amp; Back office business teams and Technology teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for resolving complex business-critical issues and requests maintaining the integrity of systems and ensuring all queries are recorded, completed or escalated appropriately to reflect their time criticality. You should have excellent customer facing skills with an appreciation of the value of communicating to stakeholders particularly during high pressure situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive monitoring of systems, triage, investigation, resolution and escalation of issues as they arise ensuring that our stakeholders are kept informed throughout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This will include monitoring Critical systems, anticipating and resolving issues as they arise and thinking of ways of reducing common problems. You will also provide 24/5 operational and business support of all critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our systems operate 24 hours a day from Sunday night to Friday evening. &lt;strong&gt;This is a shift-based role, currently operating in 2 different shifts: 10:00am - 7:00pm EEST and 11:00am - 8:00pm EET.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1st level application support for business systems with escalation to 2nd level Application Support team and Dev team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging, Recording and taking ownership of issues using Zendesk, Slack, ServiceNow or Jira system and following through to successful resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;well&amp;nbsp;organised,&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;effectively&amp;nbsp;manage&amp;nbsp;daily&amp;nbsp;issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Internal technology teams, end users or third parties as appropriate. Helpful attitude and assist users in finding out who looks after other applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;various&amp;nbsp;tasks&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;prioritising&amp;nbsp;them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;systems;&amp;nbsp;investigating,&amp;nbsp;escalation&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;resolving&amp;nbsp;alerts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing SQL scrips to resolve user queries, testing, release management by following change controls across environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;procedures&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;policies&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;keeping&amp;nbsp;them&amp;nbsp;up&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;date&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;base&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;available&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;use&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;members&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;distribute&amp;nbsp;daily&amp;nbsp;handover&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;release&amp;nbsp;notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;external&amp;nbsp;auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant&amp;nbsp;1st&amp;nbsp;line&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;Helpdesk&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Windows based environment: Windows 11, Windows Servers, Office 365Ability to multitask and remain calm under pressure is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulously accurate approach to data entry and results review is necessary, high attention to details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database&amp;nbsp;skills:&amp;nbsp;Oracle,&amp;nbsp;MS&amp;nbsp;SQL&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;script&amp;nbsp;writing&amp;nbsp;abilities&amp;nbsp;would&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Operating&amp;nbsp;Systems:&amp;nbsp;Unix&amp;nbsp;Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;.Net,&amp;nbsp;Python,&amp;nbsp;MSMQ,&amp;nbsp;RegEx,&amp;nbsp;Powershell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to applications such as Zendesk, Slack, OpsGenie, Nagios, ELK, Automate, Salerio, SWIFT and&amp;nbsp; MoveIT&amp;nbsp; Applications – some experience in or support of trading, portfolio management, risk, settlements,&amp;nbsp; and&amp;nbsp; reconciliation applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some business knowledge of financial markets and instruments, with broad asset class – Equities, Derivatives, Options, Credits etc., through previous experience within the financial services sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern&amp;nbsp;office&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;OfficeX&amp;nbsp;campus&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;easy&amp;nbsp;access&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;transport&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;amenities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25&amp;nbsp;days&amp;nbsp;holiday&amp;nbsp;allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Premium&amp;nbsp;Health&amp;nbsp;insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee&amp;nbsp;Assistance&amp;nbsp;program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referral&amp;nbsp;Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional&amp;nbsp;days&amp;nbsp;off&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;long&amp;nbsp;service&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;volunteering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multisport&amp;nbsp;card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;tech&amp;nbsp;talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conference&amp;nbsp;attendance,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;engagement&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;open-source&amp;nbsp;community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

