&lt;li&gt;Solid Linux administration fundamentals (RHEL-family and/or Ubuntu).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodical troubleshooting: you work a problem step by step, know what you have ruled out, and recognize when it is time to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with users in a technical support or operations role.&lt;/li&gt;
