&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical understanding of how to train, evaluate, and deploy models at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed Compute:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling ML workloads across GPUs and multi-node clusters using frameworks like Ray, Dask, or PyTorch Distributed.&lt;/li&gt;
